window.products.push({"id":1045004,"name":"DEVSANA Premium Coffee Maker Stand, Coffee Pod Holder, Rolling K Cup Holder, Keurig Pod Holder, Appliance Slider, K Cup Organizer, Coffee Bar Organize","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ofZ7wd+AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[COFFEE MAKER STAND] : This Keurig Pod Holder Drawer, Coffee Pod Organizer, Coffee Stand with drawer on metal link provides smooth pull and push function. You can store various Kuerig, K-Cup pods and capsules in the drawer. The ecofriendly bamboo box can carry 25 lb weight with easy roll in and out function. [DRAWER ORGANIZER WITH REMOVABLE DIVIDERS] : The removable dividers partition the drawer into 5 compartments. This allows to store up to 25 coffee pods. Kuerig, Virtuo, kcup coffee pods. The dividers can be removed if needed to increase the space for tea bags, tea pouch, ground coffee bags as well. [KITCHEN APPLIANCE SLIDER] : The Coffee Pod Drawer with rolling wheels also serves as an Appliance Caddy, Kitchen Appliance Slider. Along with Coffee Maker Machine, other appliances such as Toaster, Rice Cooker, Instant Pot, Air Fryer can also be placed on this drawer stand. [SPACIOUS COFFEE POD HOLDER STORAGE] : The appliance caddy has a drawer with rolling wheels at the back. The aesthetic handle grooved on the sides can be used to lift this drawer stand in the front and rolled back and forth on the back caster wheels. This allows this drawer stand to be pulled out from under the kitchen cabinet when in use and rolled back when not in use very easily. Front of the stand has rubber pad which protects the kitchen counter as well as this stand. [DIMENSIONS] : This convenient rolling coffee drawer takes up a small amount of counter space while still large enough to store your coffee maker on top: with a length of 15 inches, width of 13 inches, and height of 3 inches. Coffee pods not included. [NO ASSEMBLY NEEDED] : This Coffee Pod Holder, coffee Pods Storage Organizer, Kitchen Appliance Slider comes in ready to use condition, No Assembly Needed. This does not Rust, Buckle, Swell or Warp, it is Not Flimsy which will give you peace of mind.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ofZ7wd+AL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Devsana Designs","source_asin":"B0BJ4TW8YQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045004","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ4TW8YQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ4TW8YQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
