window.products.push({"id":1045102,"name":"GMOEGEFT Scandinavian Christmas Gnome Plush, Swedish Tomte, Nordic Santa Gnome, Holiday Home Decoration Birthday Gift, 17 Inches (Coffee Stand)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816TWHnqvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABOUT GNOME: Gnome, which is also called Tomte, or Nisse. According to Scandinavian folklore, they are reputed to safeguard the farmer and his family against any misfortune, especially during the night. The physical appearance of a tomte is considered to be extremely short, elderly, with a long beard and dresses in farmer’s clothing. HANDMADE: Each Gnome is handcrafted, carefully sew with attention and love. Here are various different styles to meet your demands of Christmas decoration. They are absolutely charming and will win over any Gnome lover’s heart. Pick one or begin your gnome collection. HOLIDAY GIFTS: The adorable gnome will be a unique gift for anyone at Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, and birthday time. Its delicate appearance making it an essential decoration for your fireplace, Christmas tree, shelf or table, etc; it's sure to add a fun and festive touch. SIZE & MATERIAL: 17 inches tall (from bottom to top of hat), and 5.5 inches wide. The gnome’s body is made by natural felt. The Fiber fur long beard and globular nose are accord with his traditional appearance traits. His knitted cap includes a wire, and you can pose it any way you like. The base is weighted so that he won't tip over easily. Each package included 1 Swedish Plush Gnome. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: We believe that you will fall in love with this product, but for some reason if you are not satisfied with the product, please send them back to us and we will refund you. Get these lovely gnomes today and enjoying your happy holiday!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816TWHnqvyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GMOEGEFT","source_asin":"B07HYMMQL2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07HYMMQL2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07HYMMQL2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
