window.products.push({"id":1045116,"name":"Adoric Vacuum Sealer Machine Mini Bag Sealer, Portable 2 in 1 Chip Bag Sealer Heat Seal Plastic Handheld with Detachable Hook and Cutter Better Than B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GnI-iEdtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Usage Instruction 1.Put on the batteries and press for 3-5 seconds to preheat. 2. Install the battery correctly according to anode & cathode, or the sealer will not heat. 3.For thin bags, just slide it quickly to seal. For thick bags, firstly warm up for 3-5 seconds and slide it slowly across bag opening. Do not stay in one place for too long as it can burn a hole in the bag. 4.After using, install the hook and hang it on wall. Kindly Tips 1.Please do not press the bag sealer violently in case of getting the metal plate out of shape. 2.Keep the bag free of oil and water before sealing. 3.The bag sealer needs 2 AA batteries (not included). Please buy high-quality battery form reliable dealer. 4. Please remove the battery if it is not used for a long time. 5.When the battery power is insufficient, the sealing effect will be affected, so please replace the battery. 6.This mini plastic bag sealer cannot use on the pure paper bag. 7.Please keep this bag heat sealer away from children. Specification Material: ABS Weight: 2.1oz Color: white and grey Size: 4x3.5x14.4 cm Power Source: 2 AA batteries (not included) Package content: 1 x mini bag sealer, 1 x hook and 1 x user manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51GnI-iEdtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adoric","source_asin":"B09YNKSGS3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045116","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YNKSGS3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YNKSGS3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
