window.products.push({"id":1045565,"name":"AprilAire 201 Replacement Furnace Filter for AprilAire or Space-Gard 2200 or 2250 Whole-House Air Purifiers - MERV 10, 20x25x6 Air Filter (Pack of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q0cxEfvhL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Air quality matters. That's why you trust AprilAire to keep your home environment safe for you and your family. The AprilAire 201 Healthy Air 10 Air Filter removes airborne particles as they pass through the MERV 10 filter including dust, pollen, mold spores, and pet dander. That means it makes the air throughout your home fresh and healthy so your family can breathe easy.Annual air filter replacements are a great way to keep your home and family protected. Your HVAC system is protected from airborne particles too, which helps lower your energy costs, and can prolong the life of your equipment. Lengthen your HVAC system's life and improve your home's energy-efficiency by reducing dust buildup.Efficient home and system protection - with up to 12 month filter life, you also save time on furnace filter changes compared to the traditional 1-3 month filter. AprilAire 6-inch filters provide more filter area for harmful particles to be captured compared to common 1-inch filters.The AprilAire 201 Healthy Air 10 Air Filter has a nominal air filter size of 20 x 25 x 6 inches and is compatible with AprilAire and Space-Gard Air Cleaner Models 2200 and 2250. Illustrated packaging includes detailed air filter replacement instructions. Designed and made in the USA.Save time and upgrade performance - consider the AprilAire Model 1213 High-Performance Upgrade Kit to replace your original AprilAire 201 filter with a high performance 213 filter and new filter frame system, eliminating pleat spacers (Model 1213 sold separately).Note: MERV is a scale used to measure the effectiveness of air filters. Higher number values translate to more effective filtration. *Performance tested to ASHRAE 52.2 Standard, minimum efficiency reporting value – MERV 10.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q0cxEfvhL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aprilaire","source_asin":"B0B146JQ73","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B146JQ73","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B146JQ73","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1045566,"name":"BJADE'S Portable AC Window Vent Kit,Portable Air Conditioner Seal Plates for Sliding Glass Windows.Adjustable Length Panels Up to 47 Inches for 5.9”Ex","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y9VjnptgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【5.9 Inches Diameter Portable Air Conditioner】The mouth of the plates hole is 5.9 inches.suitable for all brands portable air conditioners with 5.9-inch diameter air outlet.pls check the size and before your buying 【Vertical & Horizontal Sliding Windows】This air conditioner window kit can be installed vertically and horizontally on all sliding windows,it Can Not Be Used With casement window.The vent kit consists of 3 plates,total 120cm/47 inch length which can meet most common window in homes 【Good Sealing】This window kit keeps your room cool for longer.without air-conditioning leakage, preventing hot air from entering,Comes with sealing tape,which not only effectively isolates hot air getting in or cold air getting out,but strengthen the plates. 【Easy to install】No hose adapter required,just slot the panels together and slide them to the length needed,easy to install and also easy to remove and store for your next summer. 【Long-Lasting Durable Material】The vent hose is made of thickened pvc,durable and light weight,not easy to aging, non-toxic and pollution-free.easy to install and remove.perfect for home and office use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61y9VjnptgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BJADE‘S","source_asin":"B08XB2R511","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045566","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XB2R511","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XB2R511","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
