window.products.push({"id":1045594,"name":"Flexzion Whiskey Ice Cubes Stainless Steel Ice Cubes For Drinks Chilling Set of 6 With Pouch, Reusable Metal Whiskey Stones, Wine Chiller Rocks No Dil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t1C0ZyuNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There may be a lot of controversy around whisky stones and to side when it comes to why you should or should not use them. Some people say ice makes the drink cooler faster, and also dilute the whisky or other strong spirit with water so it isn't so strong. Maybe add some cold water and put the whisky away while they are at it too. Each has it's benefits.Unlike traditional ice stones on the market that barely cool brinks, the stainless steel metal ice cubes has a much higher thermal conductivity at about 14 watts per meter Kelvin, where as stones ceramics are at around 4 watts per meter Kelvin. Metals are about 4 times than that of ceramics. While ice cubes may cool drinks faster, they melt faster too. Using a steel ice cube not only preserve the taste and aroma of the beverage by not watering down everything, it also stays cool for longer and is more convent than having to make ice with a ice try.How To Use Whiskey Stones?- Wash the ice cubes first before putting them in the freezer for at least 1-2 hours, allowing them to thoroughly chill.- Two to four of frozen cubes are should be used per drink for maximum enjoymentPlease Note:- The cooling effect may vary from factors like temperature of the environment, the amount of your drink to be cooled, the number of cubes added, etc. If it is not your desired temperature, please add a couple more.- Dose not include tongs Specification: Stainless Steel Whisky Stones Stainless Steel Whisky Stones Material: Food Grade 304 SUS Material: Food Grade 304 SUS Cube Dimentions: 1x1x1 Inch (2.5x2.5x2.5CM) Cube Dimentions: 1x1x1 Inch (2.5x2.5x2.5CM) 6x Cubes 6x Cubes 1x Black Pouch 1x Black Pouch Package Content: 6x 1 Inch Cube Stainless Steel Ice Cubes, Metal Cooler Cube Chiller Ball Stones Cool Reusable Accessories for Men Gifts Set, Drinking Whiskey Gift, Bourbon, Scotch, Beer, Wine, Cocktail, No Metal Taste! 6x 1 Inch Cube Stainless Steel Ice Cubes, Metal Cooler Cube Chiller Ball Stones Cool Reusable Accessories for Men Gifts Set, Drinking Whiskey Gift, Bourbon, Scotch, Beer, Wine, Cocktail, No Metal Taste!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61t1C0ZyuNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flexzion","source_asin":"B0819N7FVD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0819N7FVD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0819N7FVD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
