window.products.push({"id":1045603,"name":"Wooden Cupcake Tiered Stand, Cupcake Tower Stand 3 Tier for 12 Cupcakes, EDUROMI Wood Dessert Serving Tray Stand for Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d0CjpWKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍰 Upgraded Design of Cupcake Stand - Reinforced and thickened the cupcake tier stand, adopts oval trays, thickens the middle pillar, increases the size and thickness of each tray, expands the accommodation space and increases the stability. Pillars are embedded with screws and can be installed with a simple twist. Edges of each tray are raised to prevent items from slipping. Ball handle provides a comfortable handling experience. 🍩 Perfect Size of Tiered Tray Stand - 8.5*6 inches at the top, 10*7 inches in the middle, and 12*8 inches at the bottom. 4.3 inch between each tier, 15.3 inches tall after assembly to show taller decor items. 3 tier of stacking to increase storage space. Large bottom, completely balanced around and there will be no overturning.The 3 tier cupcake stand was cut and polished with a smooth surface, sturdy and durable, support multiple reuse. 🍰 Multifunctional Center Decoration - This tray is the canvas of your creativity, just waiting to be decorated with your imagination! Firstly, tiered tray is a great dessert buffet! Using to display all kinds of exquisite cupcakes, biscuits, macarons, bread, etc. Secondly can also be used to place all kinds of fruits, keep your kitchen tidy. Finally it also a storage stall to show your favorite cups, candles, pottery, indoor plants and seasonal decorations. 🍩 Functional Retro 3 Tier Cupcake Stand for 12 to 18 Cupcakes - Wooden Cupcake Stand made of 100% premium acacia wood be installed by twisting. Rustic style makes a dessert table extra fancy. Smooth glaze, elegant shape, quality and artistic sense coexist, could be used for many years. Perfect for organizing and displaying on the countertop as a 3 tiered tray, storage and display seasonal tiered tray decorations, wedding graduation cupcakes, fruits and dessert display stand. 🍰 Ideal Gift Choice - 3 tier cupcake dessert stand suitable for displaying all your decorations and food. The best gift choice for Birthday, Graduation Party, Valentine's day, Anniversary, Thanksgiving and Christmas! Unique and elegant display shelf is the perfect choice for your kitchen, dining room or living room for any occasion! Give it to family friends who like baking cupcakes and cookies or holding parties.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d0CjpWKbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EDUROMI","source_asin":"B0BDDC9ZGK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045603","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDDC9ZGK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDDC9ZGK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
