window.products.push({"id":1045662,"name":"Parisloft 5x5''Antique Wood Black Wall Hanging Picture Frame, Rustic Distressed Retro Vintage Single Photo Frame Mordern Farmhouse Decor(Single Black ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174cSGl+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Features: 1.Double edges and deep defined ridges design with a black real wood structure,lends this beautifully crafted frame a distinguished look of age and classic appeal2.This simple style in some ways helps leverage the beauty of the picture it holds within far more beautifully.3.The frame in this case is square with a pronounced with, double edges that are slight raised giving more depth to the central panel and thus drawing focus to the picture it will hold.4.Each frame is handmade with love and sincerity, it is designed to fit a 5''x5'' photo print.5.The frame will give your spaces the touch of old memories that you can always turn to for comfort and a shot of nostalgia.. NOTE: Due to the looped hanger at top, it may not sit flat on wall.But you could use a nail in 1-1/2 inches to help it sit flush.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6174cSGl+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parisloft","source_asin":"B07PLDLBH1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045662","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PLDLBH1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PLDLBH1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1045663,"name":"Anfrere Fireplace Tools Set, 5-Pieces Indoor Outdoor Fire Place Poker Sets, A105BK","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615kTrkFY3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This 5 piece fireplace tool set provides the tools to tend your fire, and to clean the area when the flames are extinguished. The stand occupies minimal space on your hearth, while its four top hooks comfortably hold a poker, tong, brush, and shovel. Come with stable and heavy stand, the fireplace tong help to place kindling safely and reposition the logs, the fire poker works excellent to stir up the fire, the fireplace brush features firm bristles to sweep ash and debris quickly, the proper shovel for removing the ash and logs. A105BK AESTHETICS AND PRACTICALITY 31.7-inch long pole matching with a detachable solid handle, the fireplace tool has a retro beauty while adding safety to you when using the fireplace. LONG LASTING BUILT Made of heavy-duty wrought iron, more solid than cast iron, and is decently heavy, the shelf keeps your tools organized. WARM GIFT It will be a homey hearth gift idea and a housewarming gift for new house decoration. Get a set of these fireplace tools to bring warmth to your family and friends in cold winter. EXTENSIVE PRACTICABILITY It coordinates with most fire screens, log holders and racks, or outdoor fire pit tools; the robust design is stylish for both modern home decoration and country fireplaces.  The fireplace tongs help to safely place kindling and reposition logs while the fireplace brush features strong bristles to easily sweep ash and debris, conveying heat at a slow speed and avoid of burning fingers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615kTrkFY3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anfrere","source_asin":"B098R8RZ3P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098R8RZ3P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098R8RZ3P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
