window.products.push({"id":1045699,"name":"MOTZU Rabbit Shape Silicone Mold, 6-Cavity Cake Baking Bunny Large Mould DIY Chocolate Shells Mold for Easter, Cooking Supplies for Cocoa Bombs, Break","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JkfPWB5DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to make and release the film】The chocolate egg mold is easy to use, just pour your favorite ingredients into the mold and keep the ingredients still until they are fully formed. The non-stick bunny mold is easy to fall off. The egg mold is very soft and reusable. The bottom stable design keeps the product even and not easy to spill, the surface of the silicone mold is smooth and can be easily taken out. 【Soft and Easy to Use】Our mold are made of silicone, which is not easily deformed, non-sticky, easy to wash, and can be directly contacted with food; Flexible Non-Stick Silicone molds easily release polymer cubes with a simple twist, Silicone Molds won't crack. 【Product Specifications】The temperature resistance range is from -40 ℉ to 500 ℉, suitable for microwave ovens, ovens, and refrigerators; Easter egg mold size: 29.5x17x4.5cm/11.61x6.69x1.77\"; Silicone egg molds inner size 8.7x5.8x4.5cm/3.43x2.28x1.77\". Use the mold to create mousse/dessert /cake earlier and quicker. 【Wide Range of Usages】These Easter molds is suitable for making cakes, bread, mousses, jellies, chocolates, candies, soaps, candles, pendants, etc.; They are cute in appearance and suitable for various edible and non-edible materials. 【Instructions for Use and Precautions】Do, not direct contact with an open flame or near heat sources (such as toaster heating pipes), it is recommended that when you bake, mold placed in the oven in the middle or upper position. Maintain a spacing of at least 5cm with tubular heating elements. Note: please wait for cooling for about 15-20 minutes, then the release effect is better.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JkfPWB5DL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOTZU","source_asin":"B08X2FXVBK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X2FXVBK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X2FXVBK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
