window.products.push({"id":1045766,"name":"Tervis Harry Potter-Luna Quote Insulated Tumbler with Wrap and Lid, 1 Count (Pack of 1), Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LkDrFyQnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Treves insulated drinkware delivers the ultimate combination of personality and performance for pure drinking enjoyment. Treves Tumblers are double-wall insulated to keep hot drinks hot and cold drinks cold, helping to reduce condensation. They are microwave and dishwasher safe, fit most drink holders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LkDrFyQnL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tervis","source_asin":"B07Q38R48Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045766","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Q38R48Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Q38R48Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1045767,"name":"Japanese Chef's Knife ARITSUGU Blue Steel Yanagi Sashimi Kitchen 270mm 10.62\" Engraved Name","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":563.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FUPdI2KwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You can slice fish and make sushi, sashimi easily. Your cooking will go through a dramatic change! This is a Soutan Yanagi knife.It is made not only stainless steels and ceramics, but also Aoko (Blue steel #2). It is made of Japanese swords (Samurai Katana) technique for a long time, then it feature tough and sharpness.This knife is recommended for those who enjoy preparing sashimi. It is a long and thin knife which gives you ease in thinly cutting fish and shellfish. It looks very beautiful, and is a kitchen knife that attracts customers even if you are a chef.It will be one item of your brag that looks like a sword. How about sending it as a wedding gift, birthday gift or when congratulating the opening of a new business? *Brand: Tsukiji ARITSUGU *Content: One knife, box and Saya case (scabbard) *Type: Soutan Yanagi *Use: Fish (Sushi and Sashimi) *Edge angle: Single-edged *Blade material: Blue steel (Aoko #2) *Bolster material: Blond water buffalo-horn bolster *Handle material: Magnolia *Total length: Approx 420 mm (16.53\") *Blade length: Approx 270 mm (10.62\") *Blade width: Approx 35 mm (1.37\") *Blade thickness: Approx 4 mm (0.15\") *Weight: Approx 210 g (7.40 oz) *HRC (Hardness Rockwell C scale): 62+- The ARITSUGU had made Japanese swords for \"\"Samurai\"\" since 1560. It's high technique has been inherited as Japanese kitchen knives for a long time.Their swords had very sharp edged, so they dedicated them to Japanese emperor. Since the chefs use ARITSUGU, they can cut ingredients to bring out the flavor, have food imaginations more and widen their idea.That is the reason why the chefs in the world love ARITSUGU. Thank you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FUPdI2KwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tsukiji Aritsugu","source_asin":"B07TJ92DG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TJ92DG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TJ92DG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
