window.products.push({"id":1045771,"name":"AwesomeWare, [2018 New Wooden Triple Alarms Setting, 3 Levels Brightness Dimmer, Dual Time (12/24) Mode, Temperature and Humidity LED Digital Clock fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c2VFRLSCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Start your natural life with AwesomeWare Wooden Digital Alarm Clock. This fashion-designed alarm clock can be a perfect decoration for your bedroom, home furniture or office, offering you a non-radiative sleep environment. Wooden digital clock, also a considerable gift for the beloved. Sunny Time Sprite, make your home time full of natural's breathFeatures : ▶ 3 Groups Alarm Time: - no snooze, you can set a second alarm in a few-minute intervals to replace. ▶ Weekend Alarm Selectable: - alarms work for weekdays only, or work for every day. ▶ 2 Display Modes: - dP-1: time fixed display. - dP-2: time and date automatically take turns display. - both modes fixed display temperature and humidity. ▶ White LED Digit Backlight: - 3 adjustable brightness levels. - easy to read, 4.7 inch LED screen, including 2.3 inch time display. - 12H/24H, ℃/℉ is selectable. ▶ Sound-activated Function: - when sound-activated mode is on (oN Sd), LED display will auto go off after 5 seconds. - you can make noise more than 60 Db. or press any button to wake up the display. - you can turn on the sound-activated mode during sleep, to have a dark room. Important Tips: - This digital alarm clock is designed to operate on DC 5V power source, AAA battery is just a backup power. - When the main power of this clock is interrupted, the built-in cell will take over to maintain the time and alarm settings. - The volume of this alarm clock is not adjustable. What's in Box: - Digital Wooden Alarm Clock ×1- USB Cable ×1- USB AC-DC Adapter ×1- User Manual ×1Notice: Please note if you don’t know how to use this LED clock or if you have any questions about our User Manual, contact us at any time without any hesitation.?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c2VFRLSCL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AwesomeWare","source_asin":"B0043BDVVW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045771","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0043BDVVW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0043BDVVW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
