window.products.push({"id":1045813,"name":"Barista Warrior French Press with Thermometer - Insulated Coffee Press - Stainless Steel French Press Coffee Maker (1.0L, 34 fl oz, Gray)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zYVKXHlIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BUILT-IN THERMOMETER: It provides a perfect temperature. Water that is too hot will burn your coffee. If it is too cold, you won’t extract the full consistency of the beans. Our french press comes with an auto temperature gauge which allows you to brew your pour over coffee at the optimal temperature (195-205°F). Make a perfect cup of coffee every time with our easy to read coffee thermometer! KEEP COFFEE HOT LONGER: Brewer insulated design helps in keeping your coffee hot for 1 hour longer than glass. No more coffee getting cold by the second cup! Our vacuum insulated coffee press is constructed with a double-wall stainless steel metal design which provides excellent insulation between cups. It keeps your coffee hot and fresh for a long time while keeping the exterior cool to the touch! EASY TO CLEAN DUAL FILTER. Make better-tasting coffee with a Barista Warrior French Press Coffee Maker! It has double screen filter accessories that bring the delicious flavors and natural oils into your coffee while sealing the grounds in place so no residue will go into your brew. With our coffee French press, it’s easy to make a richer and cleaner cup! Super easy to use and easy to clean. BARISTA QUALITY CONSTRUCTION. Made from premium food grade stainless steel, our insulated French press kit is durable and rust-proof. It has a sleek modern design with a stay-cool handle that makes lifting and pouring a breeze. A coffee press that will surely look good in your kitchen and makes a lovely gift to your loved ones! LIFETIME WARRANTY: We provide premium barista-quality coffee and tea brewing machine for the home baristas. We take pride in the quality of our products and back it up with our 100% satisfaction guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zYVKXHlIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barista Warrior","source_asin":"B07KJGC2B5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045813","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KJGC2B5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KJGC2B5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
