window.products.push({"id":1045887,"name":"Western Multicolored 4 x 4 Absorbent Ceramic and Cork Coasters Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZdT-2kORL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"For more than 20 years, DEMDACO has designed and sold giftable products intended to “Lift the Spirit”—in times of celebration, when comfort is needed, or just to put a smile on someone’s face. The hand-curated artisan gifts it develops and distributes are chosen for their potential to help people nurture goodness in the lives of others, celebrate family and friends, and encourage people to treat themselves. We partner with artists representing a wide range of styles and mediums, and whose work is consistent with our values. Products are curated through this filter, then carefully reproduced by skilled craftspeople around the world. Under the DEMDACO brand, product categories include Gifts, Home Décor, Entertaining, Fashion, Baby, Holiday, and Outdoors. DEMDACO also maintains a partnership with artist Susan Lordi, offering her popular Willow Tree sculptures. Western Coasters come as a set of 4. Sentiments read \"Pony up\" and \"It's kind of exciting not knowing what's coming next\". Coasters are made of absorbent ceramic and cork. Comes packaged in an acetate box for easy gifting. Artist blends visual storytelling with appreciation for social commentary and the humorous side of life to create these delightful coasters. Each coaster measures approximately 4 x 4 inches. A touch of nostalgia and a knack for humor turn these coasters into a playful piece for anyone with a hint of adventure in their heart. Pair with coordinating mug (sold separately). For the cowboy or cowgirl, these coasters will make a great addition to a rustic home. Perfect gift for housewarming, wedding, or bridal shower. By Iron in the Fire Collection. Ships in protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ZdT-2kORL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEMDACO","source_asin":"B06XXLXJG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045887","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XXLXJG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XXLXJG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
