window.products.push({"id":1045909,"name":"FIVEGIVEN 3 Piece Dining Set Small Kitchen Table Set for 2, Table and 2 Chairs Dining Set, Rustic Industrial Sonoma Oak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615KJy7sAOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【About the product】 This breakfast table set for 2 is sold as a 3 piece all-inclusive set, 1 table with 2 chairs.  This 3 piece kitchen dining table set provides multi-purpose and space-saving dining solution. It is perfect for small dining room or kitchen breakfast nook, or transforming your home into an inviting lounge.  The table and chairs are standard height. There are ample spaces beneath the table for your legs, and the chairs can be tucked away neatly under the table when not in use.  - MATERIALS: double square steel tubing frame with black sandy coating and high-grade MDF board with durable Sonoma oak PVC veneer  - TABLE BOARD: 31.9\"(W)*19.7\"(D)  - CHAIR BOARD: 10.7\"(W)*13.8\"(D)  - TABLE DIMENSION: 35.6\"(W)*19.7\"(D)*29.5\"(H)  - CHAIR DIMENSION: 13.8\"(W)*13.8\"(D)*17.9\"(H)  - MAXIMUM WEIGHT CAPACITY: 250 lbs for each chair and 60 lbs for the table - GROSS WEIGHT: 40.8 lbs - COLOR OPTION: Sonoma oak/brown 【About the assembly and maintains】 Quite easy assembly, about 20-30 minutes could finish the work.  To maintain this table and chairs dining set for a durable use, please keep its surface away from sticky or sharp items, avoid harsh chemicals, just use normal household wipes for daily cleaning. 【About FIVEGIVEN】 From the day one it was born, FIVEGIVEN is devoted to provide high quality products for both home and office environment.  We pursuit simple but elegant and fashion design, with thoughtful function, to make your home and office life stylish and comfortable.  You could find 3 tier & 4 tier bookshelves in the same rustic industrial style with same Sonoma oak color by search ‘FIVEGIVEN’ on Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615KJy7sAOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FIVEGIVEN","source_asin":"B075T6MB1V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1045909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075T6MB1V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075T6MB1V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
